  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the fermented black beans and set aside.",
    "Heat olive oil in a heavy skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and minced garlic, sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in smoked paprika and oregano, cook for 30 seconds to release aromas.",
    "Add the beans and pour in vegetable broth, bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover and simmer for 20 minutes, allowing flavors to meld.",
    "Season with salt to taste and stir in fresh parsley.",
    "Wrap the stew in an agave leaf and let it steam for an additional 5 minutes before serving."
